    "body": "`MutationObserver` just needed a callback so that's why it was designed that way. I strongly suspect the other observers are copypasta. I don't think it had to do with cost per se. The cost of having to call into JS from C++ prolly dwarfs the cost of an event listener callback vs a regular callback.",
